// The proof idea:
// For any ex satisfying spec, at any suffix where p1 ∧ p2 holds:
// 1. p1 holds => eventually q1 holds (say at step witness)
// 2. p2 ∧ next => ●p2 ∨ ●q2 (by precondition)
