// So at the suffix where p2 holds: either always(p2) or eventually(q2).
// Case 1: eventually(q2) - done, (q1.and(p2)).or(q2) is satisfied
// Case 2: always(p2) - then at witness where q1 holds, p2 also holds, 
//         so (q1 ∧ p2) holds, done.
